                  <li><a href="/en/magazine/gmp-cleanroom-container-pharma-production" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-700 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#bbd700" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>GMP &amp; cleanroom containers</a></li>
